WEBVTT

00:07:28.472 --> 00:07:30.485
and the engine that it's going to work on,

00:07:30.509 --> 00:07:33.580
and no engine works well
without being warmed up.

00:07:33.604 --> 00:07:35.073
Warm up your voice.

00:07:35.482 --> 00:07:37.533
Actually, let me show you how to do that.

00:07:37.557 --> 00:07:40.512
Would you all like to stand
up for a moment?

00:07:40.536 --> 00:07:41.667
I'm going to show you

00:07:41.691 --> 00:07:46.901
the six vocal warm-up exercises
that I do before every talk I ever do.

00:07:46.925 --> 00:07:49.835
Any time you're going to talk
to anybody important, do these.

00:07:49.859 --> 00:07:52.638
First, arms up, deep breath in,

00:07:52.662 --> 00:07:55.740
and sigh out, ahhhhh, like that.

00:07:55.764 --> 00:07:57.368
One more time.

00:07:57.392 --> 00:08:00.366
Ahhhh, very good.